<main class="pt-24">
    <section class="text-center mb-16">
        <p class="uppercase tracking-[0.3em] text-[var(--sayori-orange)] text-sm">
            Guide
        </p>
        <h1 class="font-serif text-[clamp(3rem,8vw,5rem)] mt-4">
            Mafia
        </h1>
        <p class="max-w-3xl mx-auto mt-6 leading-8 text-[var(--sayori-muted)]">
            Everyone become a pro in a game, by knowing the details which no one else knows
        </p>
    </section>
    <section>
        <h2>Roles:</h2>
        <ol>
            <li><strong>Civilians:</strong> They are the innocent people living in the town.</li>
            <li><strong>Mafia:</strong> Title charecter. Their main goal is to eliminate every civilian before they eliminate them</li>
            <p>Rest of the roles are all helper roles, and are considered to be part of civilian's group.</p>
            <li><strong>Doctor</strong>: Every night doctor can protect a player, and if the player chose by mafia is same as player chose by doctor, then the player is saved from dying.</li>
            <li><strong>Revenger:</strong>When they are voted out, they can take someone down with them. Basically, you made everyone vote me out, I will take you with me.</li>
            <li><strong>Reviver:</strong> When killed by Mafia, they can revive a player who died earlier in the game.</li>
            <li><strong>Targeter:</strong> Worst nightmare for Mafia. They kill Mafia when mafia tried to kill them.</li>
        </ol>
    </section>
    <section>
        <h2>How to play</h2>
        <h3>Creating Lobby</h3>
        <p>You can create the lobby using the command <code>/mafia</code></p>
        <p>You will see an embed. If you have sayori premium, you can toggle roles from the setting embed.</p>
        <p>
            Once the setting is confirmed, bot moves to the join embed, where you have to press the button titled <code>join</code> to join the game. There are more buttons, but they are all self explainatory.
        </p>
        <p>After this the bot DMs you that you have joined the mafia lobby.</p>
        <p>When host starts, or the bot auto-start the game, you will recieve your role in DMs. Do not reveal your role in the chat.</p>
        <p>If you are mafia, you can start eliminating players, if you are civilian, then you should focus on everyone's behaviour and find out who the mafia is.</p>
        <p>Good luck playing.</p>
    </section>
</main>